stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active: add (new id, v1)
    active --> active: edit / alias / ref / move<br/>children set changed<br/>flags changed<br/>→ new node version
    active --> deprecated: deprecate<br/>(requires no active children)<br/>successors optional
    deprecated --> [*]

